	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d24r0301_swbell_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしはね　じぶんに
なにが　できるか　わからなくて▽
それを　さがすため　たびに　でたの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T04:01:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T08:24:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしはね　自分に
なにが　できるか　わからなくて▽
それを　探すため　旅に　でたの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T05:08:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T08:24:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
