				Time="2012-01-08T08:19:50" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBELL
ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T08:23:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
